<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Jan-Feb '97 tea output lower.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Jan-Feb '97 tea output lower.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's tea production in the first two months of 1997 fell 5.5 percent to 38 million kg against the same period last year, the Central Bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said in its latest economic report that tea production in the first two months of 1996 was 40.2 million kg.</p>
</text>
